dsh-bundle-manager README · Install：**Key architecture requirement**: optional third-party plugins must live in `dependencies` only (NOT in `dsh.profile.bundles`), and this plugin is the only framework bundle that mounts them at runtime. The resulting profile layout (what the CLI produces):

```json
{
  "dependencies": { "dsh-bundle-manager": "^0.5.3" },
  "dsh": { "profile": { "bundles": ["dsh-base", "dsh-web-app", "dsh-settings-ui", "dsh-bundle-manager"] } }
}
